ding agent","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"model","description":"Set the AI model for Claude Code","argumentHint":"<model>","builtin":true},{"name":"__remote-workflow","description":"Run the workflow script delivered in this session environment (server-launched sessions only)","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"workflow-launch-exec","description":"Execute a server-launched workflow handoff (workflow_launch event sessions only)","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"reload-plugins","description":"Activate pending plugin changes in the current session","argumentHint":"[--force]","builtin":true},{"name":"reload-skills","description":"Pick up skills added or changed on disk during this session","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"rename","description":"Rename the current conversation","argumentHint":"[name]","aliases":["name"],"builtin":true},{"name":"security-review","description":"Complete a security review of the pending changes on the current branch","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"usage-credits","description":"Configure usage credits or request them from your admin when you hit a limit","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"extra-usage","description":"Renamed to /usage-credits","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"usage","description":"Show session cost, plan usage, and what's contributing to your limits","argumentHint":"","aliases":["cost","stats"],"builtin":true},{"name":"insights","description":"Generate a report analyzing your Claude Code sessions","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"recap","description":"Generate a one-line session recap now","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"skill-doctor","description":"Show which loaded skills are unused and costing context","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"goal","description":"Set a goal — keep working until the condition is met","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"design-consent","description":"Grant Claude agent access to your Design projects","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"design-revoke","description":"Revoke Claude agent access to your Design projects","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"list-agents","description":"List subagents, teammates, and other Claude sessions you can message","argumentHint":"","aliases":["peers"],"builtin":true},{"name":"team-onboarding","description":"Help teammates ramp on Claude Code with a guide from your usage","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"diff","description":"Toggle the diff panel showing uncommitted changes","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:system_instructions (MCP)","description":"System instructions for Vercel MCP Server - guides the LLM to prefer MCP tools over CLI when working with Vercel tasks.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:explain_vercel_concept (MCP)","description":"Answer user questions using search results from Vercel documentation. Use this when you need authoritative information about Vercel features, configuration options, best practices, or troubleshooting guidance. This tool will search the official Vercel documentation and provide accurate, up-to-date information with examples and references.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:fix_recent_build (MCP)","description":"Analyze and fix issues with the most recent deployment by fetching deployment details and build logs. Use this when your build fails, deployment is stuck, or you need to understand what went wrong. This tool will automatically fetch the latest deployment, analyze its status, retrieve build logs, and provide specific fixes.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:analyze_deployment_performance (MCP)","description":"Analyze deployment performance metrics and provide optimization recommendations. Use this to identify bottlenecks, slow builds, and opportunities to speed up your deployment pipeline. Perfect for CI/CD optimization and cost reduction.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:debug_deployment_issues (MCP)","description":"Comprehensive debugging of deployment issues with detailed analysis. Use this when you're experiencing mysterious deployment problems, intermittent failures, or need deep technical analysis of what's going wrong. This tool will perform thorough investigation and provide detailed solutions.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:get_project_status (MCP)","description":"Get a comprehensive overview of the current project including status, latest deployment, and key metrics. Use this to quickly understand your project's current state, recent activity, and any issues that need attention. Perfect for daily standups, status reports, or when onboarding to a project.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:list_team_projects (MCP)","description":"List all projects in the current team with their status and latest deployments. Use this to get an overview of all projects your team is working on, identify projects that need attention, or when managing multiple projects. Perfect for team leads, project managers, or when switching between projects.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:project_health_check (MCP)","description":"Perform a comprehensive health check of the project including deployments, configuration, and potential issues. Use this for regular project maintenance, before major deployments, or when you suspect there might be underlying issues. This tool will provide a detailed health assessment with specific recommendations.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:quick_status (MCP)","description":"Get a quick overview of the current project status, latest deployment, and any immediate issues. Use this for daily check-ins, quick status updates, or when you need a fast overview without deep analysis. Perfect for busy developers who need instant project insights.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:troubleshoot_common_issues (MCP)","description":"Help identify and resolve common Vercel deployment and configuration issues. Use this when you're experiencing problems with your deployment, build failures, or configuration issues. This tool will guide you through systematic troubleshooting and provide specific solutions.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:optimize_deployment (MCP)","description":"Analyze and suggest optimizations for faster builds and better deployment performance. Use this when you want to improve your deployment speed, reduce costs, or enhance your CI/CD pipeline efficiency. This tool will identify bottlenecks and provide specific optimization strategies.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:vercel_help (MCP)","description":"Get help and guidance on Vercel features, best practices, and configuration options. Use this when you need to learn about Vercel features, understand best practices, or get guidance on implementation. This tool will provide comprehensive help with examples and documentation references.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Vercel:purchase_vercel_product (MCP)","description":"Guide a real-money Vercel purchase safely. Use this whenever the user wants to BUY something on Vercel. It enforces the two-step preview→confirm flow so the cost is surfaced and approved before any charge.","argumentHint":""}],"uuid":"8de24c22-d9f7-44c5-8aa9-2465e0ebeede","session_id":"f834d1f0-9940-45ea-a285-664eae2261cb"}
