files & paths\n- `source.txt` — the only product description; takeaway: offline, one person, title+body records, no sync/concurrency.\n- `AGENTS.md` — project rule: do not commit; work only on what is asked.\n\n## Unknowns & open questions\n- Expected note count / total size (tens vs tens of thousands) — not stated; treat as an assumption with \"if wrong\".\n- Whether search across bodies is needed — not stated; assumption.\n- Implementation language/runtime — not stated.\n\n## Deliverable type (Gate 0)\n- Type: decision\n- Rationale: followed literally, the danger is choosing the wrong storage format (a genuine either/or), not omitting parts of a complete spec.\n- **Implementer**: a human (user confirmed)\n- Machinery budget: human implementer of unknown skill — keep the recommendation low-machinery.\n\n## Frame selection\n- Frame: backward\n- Rationale: user override; also fits — nothing unknown about the cause, one open choice, acceptance criteria can derive it.\n\n## Style selection\n- Style: opus\n- Execution mode: standalone\n- Rationale: user override.\n\n## Output contract\n- Plan file: `plans/json-vs-sqlite-notes/plan.md`\n\n## Retrospective\n"}}}
