{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012JxvDNTCRrR5DtatNk7kNy","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Context Packet — json-vs-sqlite-notes\n2\t- Date: 2026-09-30\n3\t- Requested by: zeriong\n4\t- Language of artifacts: English\n5\t\n6\t## Run stamp — record, never guess\n7\t- plan-smith version: 1.7.0 (from `.claude-plugin/plugin.json`)\n8\t- frames.md fingerprint: 431 lines\n9\t- Main agent model: claude-opus-5-5\n10\t- plan-writer model: pending (dispatched with alias `opus`, resolved by `latest-model.py` as newest opus)\n11\t- Skill invocation: Claude `/plan-smith:forge` (interactive session; user pre-approved inputs and asked to skip the confirmation question)\n12\t\n13\t## Task (one line)\n14\tDecide between a single JSON file and SQLite as the storage layer for an offline, single-user note app.\n15\t\n16\t## Background (why now)\n17\tThe user is choosing a local persistence format before building the app. `source.txt` states the product: \"A local offline note app for one person; title and body records, no sync and no concurrency.\"\n18\t\n19\t## Goal — definition of success\n20\tA short decision plan (under 250 words) that picks one option, says which acceptance criteria drove the pick and which alternative each criterion kills, and gives the rejected option a revival trigger.\n21\t\n22\t## Hard constraints\n23\t- Offline, single user, local only — source: source.txt, confirmed by user\n24\t- Records are notes with title and body — source: source.txt\n25\t- No sync, no concurrency — source: user confirmed\n26\t- Plan length under 250 words — source: user\n27\t- No code implementation, no commits — source: user + AGENTS.md\n28\t\n29\t## Soft preferences\n30\t- Short, decision-focused; not a build-out spec.\n31\t\n32\t## Rejected alternatives (and why)\n33\t- Hosted/remote database — rejected by user (app is offline, single-user; do not re-propose)\n34\t\n35\t## Decisions already made\n36\t- Frame `backward`, style `opus` — user specified in invocation.\n37\t- Implementer is a human — user confirmed.\n38\t\n39\t## Relevant files & paths\n40\t- `source.txt` — the only product description; takeaway: offline, one person, title+body records, no sync/concurrency.\n41\t- `AGENTS.md` — project rule: do not commit; work only on what is asked.\n42\t\n43\t## Unknowns & open questions\n44\t- Expected note count / total size (tens vs tens of thousands) — not stated; treat as an assumption with \"if wrong\".\n45\t- Whether search across bodies is needed — not stated; assumption.\n46\t- Implementation language/runtime — not stated.\n47\t\n48\t## Deliverable type (Gate 0)\n49\t- Type: decision\n50\t- Rationale: followed literally, the danger is choosing the wrong storage format (a genuine either/or), not omitting parts of a complete spec.\n51\t- **Implementer**: a human (user confirmed)\n52\t- Machinery budget: human implementer of unknown skill — keep the recommendation low-machinery.\n53\t\n54\t## Frame selection\n55\t- Frame: backward\n56\t- Rationale: user override; also fits — nothing unknown about the cause, one open choice, acceptance criteria can derive it.\n57\t\n58\t## Style selection\n59\t- Style: opus\n60\t- Execution mode: standalone\n61\t- Rationale: user override.\n62\t\n63\t## Output contract\n64\t- Plan file: `plans/json-vs-sqlite-notes/plan.md`\n65\t\n66\t## Retrospective\n67\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hw2aZhUYsRE3ZjPxhrVDHh","session_id":"f834d1f0-9940-45ea-a285-664eae2261cb","uuid":"af94da0a-1333-4b32-94fe-a63e18cc9228","timestamp":"2026-09-30T03:54:55.285Z","subagent_type":"plan-smith:plan-writer","task_description":"Write JSON vs SQLite plan"}
